<div class='sc-content'>

<article id="post-913" class="post-913 page type-page status-publish hentry">
	
	<div class="entry-content">
		<div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid sc-gridless"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		<h2 class="wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading">LISTEN LIVE to WESTWOOD ONE SPORTS TALK</h2>
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://player.listenlive.co/77461" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/07/live-button-2-150x150.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="Live_Button 2" /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><strong><a href="https://player.listenlive.co/77461">TAP IN TO LISTEN LIVE!</a></strong></p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		<h2 class="wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading">Sports Talk Line Up</h2>
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/12/the-drake-toll-show-150x150.webp" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="The Drake Toll Show"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><strong><a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac">THE DRAKE TOLL SHOW</a>  Monday &#8211; Friday 6:00 AM &#8211; 9:00 AM ET</strong></p>
<p class="p1">This isn’t just another sports morning show – it’s the evolution of sports audio. Every morning, The Drake Toll Show brings a fresh, modern voice to sports talk, one that thrives on authenticity, energy, and connection. Drake isn’t here to shout hot takes or dominate the mic. He’s here to lead a conversation that feels alive – up-tempo, interactive, and impossible to ignore.</p>
<p class="p1">As a broadcast entertainer with the Savannah Bananas – the fastest-growing organization in sports – Drake knows how to captivate an audience and make every moment unforgettable. He’s also a leading voice in the podcast world as host of Locked On Big 12.</p>
<p class="p1">Drake brings sharp insight, fearless opinions, and a natural ability to connect. He thrives on conversation, and uses every platform – on-air, online, and social – to make listeners part of the experience. Expect a show that feels like the liveliest sports bar in town: smart, fun, and impossible to skip.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/12/wwosports247-betmgmyoubetteryoubet-2000x2000-2-400x400-1-150x150.webp" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="WWOSports247-BetMGMYouBetterYouBet-2000x2000-2-400x400"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><b><a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac">MGM BET &#8211; YOU BETTER YOU BET with NICK KOSTOS</a>  Monday &#8211; Friday 9:00 AM &#8211; 12:00 PM ET</b></p>
<p class="p1">Bet MGM &#8211; You Better You Bet is hosted by Nick Kostos, the King of Wagertainment. Nick brings his signature electric delivery and can’t-miss analysis to break down the biggest games and storylines every morning. You Better You Bet guarantees essential listening with top-tier guests and insightful, strong opinions. This is your daily source for an unforgettable sports talk experience built for today’s fan.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/12/wwosports247-bleckabdalla-2000x2000-1-400x400-1-150x150.webp" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="WWOSports247-BleckAbdalla-2000x2000-1-400x400"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><b><a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac">BLECK &amp; ABDALLA</a> Monday &#8211; Friday 12:00 PM &#8211; 3:00 PM ET</b></p>
<p class="p1">Chris Bleck and Adam Abdalla have been friends for nearly 20 years, first connecting in college and growing up together as producers and hosts on Chicago’s ESPN 1000. Their show possesses a natural chemistry – smart, fast, and fun. It feels like two lifelong friends inviting you into the conversation.</p>
<p class="p1">From breaking news to fearless takes, they mix insider knowledge with humor and an immersive approach, covering the NFL and the biggest viral sports moments, in the moment. With listener calls that literally keep fans at the center of the conversations and a strong digital presence, Bleck &amp; Abdalla deliver a midday sports escape that’s as entertaining as it is connected.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://www.westwoodonesports.com/player/?playerID=3675" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/07/jim-rome-150x150.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="Jim Rome"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><a href="https://www.westwoodonesports.com/player/?playerID=3675"><strong>THE JIM ROME SHOW  Monday &#8211; Friday 3:00 PM &#8211; 6:00 PM ET</strong></a></p>
<p><strong>The Nation&#8217;s Premier Sports Radio Talk Show</strong></p>
<p><em>The Jim Rome Show</em> a.k.a. <em>The Jungle</em> is three hours of Jim Rome at his best – aggressive, informed sports opinions, rapid-fire dialogue, and plenty of sports smack. As one of the most prolific sports talk hosts in America, The Jungle draws massive tune-in with legions of fans known as clones, who live for Rome’s “take” on the day’s largest issues in sports.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/12/wwosports247-betmgmtonight-2000x2000-2-400x400-1-150x150.webp" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="WWOSports247-BetMGMTonight-2000x2000-2-400x400"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><b><a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac">BET MGM &#8211; BET MGM TONIGHT with BRAD EVANS &amp; PAT BOYLE</a>  Monday &#8211; Friday 6:00 PM &#8211; 11:00 PM ET</b></p>
<p class="p1">Immerse yourself in the action every night with BetMGM Tonight, your live central hub for every pivotal moment across the sports world. Brad Evans and his co-host Pat Boyle deliver five hours of high-energy, interactive sports talk, covering the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, and College Sports. Combining real-time interaction with sharp, responsible betting insights and essential analysis.   BetMGM Tonight makes you part of the biggest games and the biggest stories every night.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/12/wwosports247-lynnellwillingham-2000x2000-1-400x400-1-150x150.webp" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="WWOSports247-LynnellWillingham-2000x2000-1-400x400"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><b><a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac">WESTWOOD ONE SPORTS NIGHT with LYNNELL WILLINGHAM</a>  Monday &#8211; Wednesday 11:00 PM &#8211; 3:00 AM ET; Saturday &amp; Sunday 1:00 PM &#8211; 4:00 PM</b></p>
<p class="p1"><b>Lynnell Willingham</b> brings undeniable energy every time he’s on the mic. His larger-than-life presence, and tell it to your face mentality will ignite Westwood One Sports Night into spirited, opinion-packed conversations that keep fans locked in. With roots in Washington DC sports radio and a reputation for unfiltered takes with an interactive style, he covers the stories fans care about most with enthusiasm and authenticity that’s second to none.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/12/wwosports247-joshgraham-2000x2000-1-400x400-1-150x150.webp" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="" title="WWOSports247-JoshGraham-2000x2000-1-400x400"  /></a>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><b><a href="https://playerservices.streamtheworld.com/api/livestream-redirect/JIM_ROMEAAC.aac">WESTWOOD ONE SPORTS NIGHT with JOSH GRAHAM</a>  Wednesday &#8211; Friday 11:00 PM &#8211; 3:00 AM ET; Saturday &amp; Sunday 4:00 PM &#8211; 7:00 PM ET</b></p>
<p class="p1"><b>Josh Graham</b> brings a distinctive, national voice to Westwood One Sports Night – rooted in years of covering college and pro sports in ACC country. Josh has a unique perspective on the storylines shaping football, basketball, and beyond at every level.</p>
<p class="p1">Known for his relentless curiosity and ability to ask thoughtful, unexpected questions, Josh delivers provocative insights and marquee guests while exploring the biggest national conversations in ways that leave listeners captivated and wanting more. His knowledgeable takes will have you saying; “I never thought about it like that”.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element" ><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span style="border-color:#37baf2;" class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid sc-gridless"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		<h2 class="wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading">Local Sports Talk</h2>
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<a href="https://www.westwoodonesports.com/player/?playerID=3678" target="_self" class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://media-cdn.socastsrm.com/wordpress/wp-content/blogs.dir/3854/files/2025/08/knbr-150x150.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail" alt="KNBR Sports Leader - SF" title="knbr"  /></a>
		</figure>
